Project: Infiniti Transit – Direct Booking Landing
1️⃣ CORE STRATEGY
Primary Goal:

Generate more bookings directly from website.

Secondary Goals:

Build trust fast

Showcase vehicles clearly

Show trip coverage

Make WhatsApp the fastest conversion path

Core Conversion Rule:

Every 2 sections → visible booking trigger.

No user should scroll more than 1.5 screens without seeing a CTA.

2️⃣ TECH STACK

HTML5 semantic structure

Tailwind CSS utility styling

GSAP + ScrollTrigger (animation)

Vanilla JS modular structure

Optimized images (WebP)

No frameworks

3️⃣ PERFORMANCE ANIMATION RULES (MANDATORY)
✅ Only animate:

transform (translate, scale, rotate)

opacity

small filter effects (light blur)

clip-path (light usage)

❌ Never animate:

height

width

margin

padding

top / left positioning

box-shadow on large containers

border-radius on large containers

Why?

Layout properties = reflow + repaint
Transform + opacity = GPU accelerated

4️⃣ FULL PAGE STRUCTURE
🔹 1. HERO SECTION
Purpose:

Immediate trust + immediate action.

Layout:

Background image (vehicle in motion)

Headline:
“Reliable Travel. Comfortable Journeys.”

Subtext:
“Professional taxi & tour services across multiple destinations.”

CTA Buttons:
[Book Now] → WhatsApp
[View Vehicles] → Scroll

Animation:

Fade + translateY

Buttons scale hover only

Conversion Element:

Primary CTA uses:

https://wa.me/917994334254?text=Hi%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20trip
🔹 2. ABOUT SECTION
Purpose:

Build legitimacy.

Content:

Years of service

Safe drivers

Clean vehicles

On-time guarantee

Layout:

Split:
Left → Image
Right → Text

Animation:

Left → translateX(-50 → 0)
Right → translateX(50 → 0)

Opacity fade included.

🔹 3. TRUST METRICS (SOCIAL PROOF)
Content Example:

1200+ Trips Completed

35+ Destinations Covered

8+ Vehicles Available

4.8★ Customer Rating

Animation:

Count up numbers

TranslateY entrance

Stagger fade

No number height shift.

🔹 4. VEHICLE SHOWCASE
Purpose:

Show capability.

Each Card:

Vehicle image

Seating capacity

AC / Non AC

Best for (family, tour, airport)

Book button

Interaction:

Hover:

scale(1.03)

subtle overlay fade

Scroll:
Stagger fade + translateY

No expanding card animations.

🔹 5. DESTINATIONS / TOURIST PLACES
Purpose:

Trigger imagination.

Layout:

Grid of destinations.

Each card:

Large image

Location name

“Explore Trip” button

Hover:
Image scale(1.05)
Overlay fade

No resizing grid items.

🔹 6. PACKAGES / TRIP TYPES
Examples:

Airport Pickup

One Day Tour

Multi-Day Tour

Custom Trip

Each card:

Icon

Description

WhatsApp CTA

Animation:
Fade + slight translateY.

🔹 7. REVIEWS (TESTIMONIALS)
Purpose:

Trust multiplier.

Layout:

Horizontal slider track.

Animation:
Use transform X for sliding.
Never animate left property.

Auto loop or manual arrow.

🔹 8. FAQ SECTION
Purpose:

Remove friction.

Questions:

How do I book?

Are drivers experienced?

Payment methods?

Cancellation policy?

Animation:

Accordion via:

scaleY transform
OR

max-height with overflow hidden (minimal use)

Avoid height animation loops.

