Mobile Consideration:

Ensure it does not block CTA buttons.

5️⃣ SCROLL ANIMATION SYSTEM

Register once:

gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

Generic section pattern:

gsap.from(".animate-section", {
  scrollTrigger: {
    trigger: ".animate-section",
    start: "top 80%"
  },
  y: 60,
  opacity: 0,
  duration: 1,
  ease: "power3.out"
});

Keep triggers minimal.
Group elements.
Avoid creating 40 separate triggers.

6️⃣ CTA DISTRIBUTION STRATEGY

Place “Book Now”:

Hero

After Vehicles

After Destinations

Before Footer

Never only once.

7️⃣ MOBILE-FIRST PRIORITY

Test on:

375px width

768px width

Rules:

No oversized headings

Cards stack vertically

WhatsApp not covering buttons

Minimum tap size 44px

8️⃣ VISUAL IDENTITY

Choose one:

Luxury:

Black / gold / champagne

Modern:

Dark navy / white / orange accent

Avoid:

Random gradients

Neon unless brand supports it

Consistency builds trust.

9️⃣ FILE STRUCTURE

index.html
assets/images
assets/icons
js/main.js
css (optional custom overrides)

Keep JS separated by function blocks.

🔟 PERFORMANCE CHECKLIST

Before delivery:

✔ Lighthouse > 85
✔ No layout shift
✔ No heavy shadow animations
✔ Images lazy loaded
✔ WebP format
✔ WhatsApp link tested
✔ Tel link tested

CONVERSION PSYCHOLOGY RULES

People booking transport care about:

Safety

Reliability

Price transparency

Quick response

So:

Emphasize:
“Instant WhatsApp Response”
“Professional Drivers”
“Clean & Sanitized Vehicles”

Not:
Fancy animations.